<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Reset Your Kaban Password</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f8f9fa; color: #7A7A7A; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 30px auto; background: white; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    .header { background: #437EF7; color: white; padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; }
    .content { padding: 40px 30px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .button { display: inline-block; background: #28a745; color: white !important; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0; }
    .footer { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #54595F; border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef; }
    .footer a { color: #437EF7; text-decoration: none; }
    h1, h2 { color: #54595F; }
    .muted { font-size: 13px; color: #7A7A7A; word-break: break-all; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <img
        src="https://res.cloudinary.com/di6b1s0gf/image/upload/c_trim,g_auto/v1771643747/6_bskxw1.png"
        alt="Kaban Logo"
        style="max-width: 360px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; display: block;"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Reset Your Password</h2>
      <p>Hello,</p>
      <p>We received a request to reset your Kaban password.</p>
      <p>Click the button below to create a new password:</p>

      <!-- IMPORTANT: resetUrl must already be a full URL including ?token=... -->
      <!-- Do NOT wrap again as ...?token={{resetUrl}} -->
      <p style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="button">Reset Password</a>
      </p>

      <p class="muted">
        If the button doesn’t work, copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>
        {{resetUrl}}
      </p>

      <p>This link will expire in <strong>{{validity}}</strong>.</p>
      <p>If you didn’t request this reset, you can safely ignore this email — your account is still secure.</p>

      <p>Best regards,<br>The Kaban Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      Kaban.ng | …real estate at your convenience!<br>
      <a href="https://www.kaban.ng/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> •
      <a href="https://www.kaban.ng/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>